00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:30,200
 and what is DeFi treasury, which is very scary to me.

353
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:32,560
 Like I think as well.

354
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:35,400
 Yeah, well, so actually, I think, Jesse,

