00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:58,640
 but I think the language is too broad and a little too.

386
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:01,640
 - And other changes, like L2, L2, that's what I want.

387
00:17:01,640 --> 00:17:02,640
 - Yeah, totally.

388
00:17:02,640 --> 00:17:04,840
 So yeah, so I'll just, I'll give a few examples.

389
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:07,040
 And I think for us, this will hit especially close to home

390
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:09,640
 because all three of us have done a lot of thinking

391
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:12,160
 and writing about like different kind of measures

392
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:16,060
 that DeFi protocols use and have been experimenting with

393
00:17:16,060 --> 00:17:20,160
 to try to keep users safe and to respond

394
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:22,040
 to like emergencies or things like that, right?

395
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:26,200
 So like one example is asset curation, right?

