00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,160
 to manage risk and to protect users, right?

401
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:46,760
 But under this bill, that sort of discretion could be read

402
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:50,080
 as control over trading, even when it's transparent

