00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:52,120
 or rules-based.

404
00:17:52,120 --> 00:17:54,520
 And then another example that I'm sure a lot of people

405
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:58,480
 are familiar with, many DeFi protocols, I would say,

