413
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:24,240
 to respond to security incidents like hacks or exploits, right?

414
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:27,840
 So it doesn't allow you to unilaterally reroute

415
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:31,240
 or like withdraw funds, it just lets you pause things

